'Change to Q3.12 and compare wrap, saturate and error-return APIs. Derive a dot-product accumulator width from maximum length instead of copying the Q1.15 constants.',
['Write both input scales and the product scale.','Test both signs of an exact half-way product.','Round a nonnegative magnitude, restore the sign and clamp before narrowing.'],
